## Overview

Gemini 2.5 Flash Image (aka nano-banana) powers virtual try-on tools that deliver seamless blending for fashion applications.

## Key Capabilities for Virtual Try-On

Users can upload a photo and add an outfit to let AI generate hyper-realistic try-on visuals across any style or category. The AI generates seamless virtual try-ons with natural blending that ensures realistic proportions, lighting, and textures.

## Fashion Model & Clothing Reference Features

Users can upload their photo to generate personalized avatars in various artistic styles (Hyperrealistic, Anime, Cartoon, Pixel Art, Sci-Fi), then virtually try on clothing items by uploading product images. 

The Gemini 2.5 Flash engine ensures apparel aligns with body shape, posture, and perspective, and developers can instruct the AI using prompt-driven editing to overlay garments while accounting for fabric properties and lighting.

## Real-World Applications

Google's virtual try-on tool allows users with just a selfie to have the Gemini 2.5 Flash Image model generate a full body digital version for virtual try-on. Users can choose from pre-set looks including Casual, Formal, Summer Dress, Winter Coat, and can virtually try on both clothing and accessories like shirts, dresses, pants, coats, hats, jewelry, and sunglasses.


