## Flat-Lay and Product Photography

Gemini 2.5 Flash Image can create top-down "flat lay" photographs by placing products alongside their included items on a specified surface. When instructed to use a master image as the foundation, it ensures the lighting, colors, and textures are a perfect match.

## Fashion Photography Applications

The model can create professional e-commerce fashion photos by taking elements from multiple images (like a dress from one image and a model from another) and generating a realistic, full-body shot with adjusted lighting and shadows.

## Key Capabilities for Product Generation

AI image generation with Gemini 2.5 Flash is fundamentally changing the e-commerce landscape by democratizing professional-quality product photography, allowing brands to create stunning, diverse, and on-brand visuals at a fraction of the cost and time.

The model's core capabilities for e-commerce include text-to-image creation for brand new product shots from text descriptions, and image plus text editing to upload existing photos and add props or change backgrounds.

## Technical Details

Gemini 2.5 Flash Image is Google's latest, fastest, and most efficient natively multimodal model, and it now supports 10 different aspect ratios, allowing for effortless content creation across various formats.


